 'Requires a PAM (NGG for SpCas9); NHEJ yields indels in most cells, HDR efficiency is typically < 20% and cell-cycle-dependent.',
 'Guide length|≈ 20 nt;Typical HDR efficiency|≲ 20%', 'MIC:12.4',
